KUBRA KE TOOTE KHALB KI AWAAZ THI YEHI FARYAAD YA ALI <br>
KAISI AJEEB DEKHIYE SHAADI MERI HUWI FARYAAD YA ALI<br>
<br>
DO PAL MEIN BEWA HOGAYI MAIEN SHAH-E-MASHRAQAIN KISSE KARONGI BAIN<br>
 SUGHRA BAHEN BHI DUR MADINE MEIN REH GAYI FARYAAD YA ALI <br>
<br>
EK SHOWR THA KE GHODE SE IBNE HASSAN GIRA DIL MERA PHAT GAYA ,<br>
 SUNTI HOON LAASH GHODON SE PAMAAL HOGAYI FARYAAD YA ALI<br>
<br>
DULHAN KO TOH LIBAASE UROOSI PINHATE HAIN MEHENDI LAGATE HAIN,<br>
 GHONGAT MAIEN KAISE DAALTI CHADAR BHI CHHIN GAYI FARYAAD YA ALI <br>
<br>
DEKHO MERE BADAN MEIN HAIN BEWA KA PAIRAHAN JAISE KE HO KAFAN,<br>
 KANGNE KI JA KALAYI MEIN RASSI HAI BANDH GAYI FARYAAD YA ALI<br>
<br>
ASHAN HAR EK SIMT THA EK HASHR KA SAMAAN ROOTI THI BIBIYAN ,<br>
 KUBRA TADAP KE KEHTI THI MAIEN KYON NA MARGAYI FARYAAD YA ALI..